    {
      "name": "huskar_berserkers_blood",
      "id": 5273,
      "name_zh": "狂战士之血",
      "name_en": "Berserker's Blood",
      "description_zh": "哈斯卡的伤痛赐予他力量，根据他损失的生命值将获得攻击速度、魔法抗性和生命恢复加成。生命恢复为力量的一定百分比。",
      "description_en": "Huskar's injuries feed his power, giving increased attack speed, magic resistance and health regen based on missing health. Health regen is a percentage of your strength.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "加成效果为线性增加，满血时没有加成，%hp_threshold_max%%%生命时达到最大加成。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Bonuses are provided linearly, no bonus at Full HP and full bonus at strictly less than %hp_threshold_max%%% HP."
      ],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/2",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
      "upgrade_text": {
        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "",
          "zh": ""
        },
        "shard_loc": {
          "en": "Huskar can activate Berserker's Blood for a health cost to cauterize himself. Dispels Huskar, then after a delay, heals for the amount of health consumed plus an additional bonus per debuff dispelled.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel",
          "zh": "哈斯卡可以消耗一定生命来主动开启狂战士之血，炙疗哈斯卡。进行驱散，然后在一定延迟后回复消耗的生命，并且每驱散一个负面状态，他就会额外回复生命。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散"
        }
      },
      "facet_text_en": [
        "",
        "",
        "Berserker's Blood can be activated for a health cost. Dispels Huskar, then after a delay, heals for the amount of health consumed plus an additional bonus per debuff dispelled.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel",
        ""
      ],
      "facet_text_zh": [
        "",
        "",
        "狂战士之血可以消耗一定生命来主动开启。驱散哈斯卡，然后在一定延迟后回复消耗的生命，并且每驱散一个负面状态，他就会额外回复生命。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散",
